'''Dragon Rider''' (ドラゴンライダー, ''Doragonraidā'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dragon Rider
|image = E 218.png
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 400円 - 1,580円
}}

==Enemy==
Long-ranged units with high damage can easily destroy this enemy. Just bring [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or another unit with a range over 300 to take it out.

